OL,3,GNEWSAGamer granny is oldest female
OL,4,AFortnite streamer in world record book
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old Scottish grandmother has
OL,7,Fbeen named the world's oldest female
OL,8,FFortnite streamer by Guinness World
OL,9,FRecords.
OL,11,FCath Bowie, from Moray, began playing
OL,12,Fthe online shooter in 2017 and now has
OL,13,Fan audience of more than 24,000
OL,14,Ffollowers.
OL,16,FShe was introduced to the game by her
OL,17,Fgrandson, who was 17 at the time, and
OL,18,Fsays no-one is "ever too old to start
OL,19,Fgaming".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
